meta {
  name: Payment-match cron requires auth
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/cron/payment-match
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer wrong-secret
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 403
}

settings {
  followRedirects: false
}

docs {
  The payment matcher marks invoices paid, so an unauthenticated caller must
  never reach it. Same gate as the other cron routes: a wrong or absent bearer
  returns 403 when CRON_SECRET is set in the app's env. With CRON_SECRET unset
  the route has no secret to check and this assertion does not apply (see
  bruno/README.md and Local.bru).
}
